WEBVTT

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:31.199
wrestling,

00:01:31.199 --> 00:01:32.395
javelin throwing,

00:01:32.395 --> 00:01:34.122
and hurling the discus events

00:01:34.122 --> 00:01:38.883
known as the pentathlon
inspired world-class competition,

00:01:38.883 --> 00:01:40.135
and the pankration,

00:01:40.135 --> 00:01:45.010
a no holds barred fight where only
biting and eye-gouging were prohibited,

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:48.576
ensured the toughest men were victorious.

00:01:48.576 --> 00:01:50.862
And victorious they were.

00:01:50.862 --> 00:01:53.369
Nobody tops the local baker Coroebus,

00:01:53.369 --> 00:01:59.184
who 776 BC became the very first
Olympic champion.

00:01:59.184 --> 00:02:02.599
And we'll never forget Orsippus of Megara,